WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.038
Probate or trust?

2
00:00:02.038 --> 00:00:05.250
Here is a plain comparison.

3
00:00:05.350 --> 00:00:06.065
Time.

4
00:00:06.065 --> 00:00:08.119
Probate is court-supervised,

5
00:00:08.119 --> 00:00:11.395
so it often takes months to over a year.

6
00:00:11.395 --> 00:00:14.284
A trust can usually be settled faster,

7
00:00:14.284 --> 00:00:18.100
since no court has to approve each step.

8
00:00:18.350 --> 00:00:19.115
Cost.

9
00:00:19.115 --> 00:00:22.557
Probate can mean court fees and attorney fees

10
00:00:22.557 --> 00:00:25.329
set by statute or by hourly rate,

11
00:00:25.329 --> 00:00:27.433
depending on the state.

12
00:00:27.433 --> 00:00:29.950
A trust costs more to set up,

13
00:00:29.950 --> 00:00:33.100
but often less to administer.

14
00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:34.047
Privacy.

15
00:00:34.047 --> 00:00:35.890
Probate filings are public.

16
00:00:35.890 --> 00:00:39.180
Trust administration usually stays private.

17
00:00:39.350 --> 00:00:40.294
Effort.

18
00:00:40.294 --> 00:00:43.397
A trust has to be funded and kept up

19
00:00:43.397 --> 00:00:44.476
to date.

20
00:00:44.476 --> 00:00:47.881
Skip that, and some assets may still go

21
00:00:47.881 --> 00:00:50.100
through probate.

22
00:00:50.350 --> 00:00:53.635
Smaller estates may not need either.

23
00:00:53.635 --> 00:00:57.110
Talk to us about your numbers.
